      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tauti arakëra Abhaamoni na Abhaasuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano gayö gaahetërë Nahasi ömögambi wa Abhaamoni agakua, na ömoona waae öno aarë köbhërëkëroa iga Hanuni akabha ömögambi kuibhaga re isawaabho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ömögambi Tauti akagamba iga, “Nëëndakorre Hanuni ömoona, wa Nahasi amaiya kehaara isawaabho aankoreeyë.” Köhayö, Tauti agatöma abhakoramërëmo bhaae bhakahëërra Hanuni amakeerio ga kömöhonia gikugira ya uruku ro isawaabho. Hano abhakoramërëmo bha Tauti bhahikërë gönsë ya Abhaamoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abhanene bha Abhaamoni bhagateebhia ömönene waabho Hanuni iga, “Gösë, ngökanya örë iga Tauti naasöökërë isaweinyu kögötöma abhakoramërëmo bhaae gucha gököhonia? Tauti tatömëre abhantö gucha guisuuncha na köhenyahenya umugi sooki bhaguimiki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo mbe, Hanuni akagoota abhakoramërëmo bhaara bha Tauti akagingira këra umui waabho iribhaara ri ëkereesa, agatandrra ichingëbho chaabho gataigatai kuhika kömatörö hakurua akabhahaatëra iga bhayi bhoobho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakamaaha ichinsoni bhökong'u kuringa ka. Hano Tauti aateebhibhui amang'ana gayö naatömërë abhantö bhakabhaturang'ana kugira abhatömöa bhaara mbaarööchë ichinsoni ichinene. Ömögambi nawe akabhateebhia iga “Möbheere kumugi go Yeriko, kuhika hano mörëmeera ichinka, hakurua muringe ka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Abhaamoni bharöchë iga bharirriyi Tauti, mbakomboyë abhasirikare ibhiköë mërongo ëbhërë (20,000) bhano bhaarë kögenda na amagörö gukurua Bheti-rehobhu na Sobha abhasirikare ibhiköë ikumi na bhibhërë 12,000, gukurua Tobhu na ömögambi Maaka aana abhasirikare ëgëköë kimui (1,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Tauti nawe aiguurë amang'ana gayö naatömërë Yoabhu kuya na iricheesi rionsui ria abhakarë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaamoni bhakarichoka bhaiseemiri kimui kuiihi, na kuya kuihita re Rabha umugi goobho ömönene na Abhaasuru gukurua Sobha na Rehobhu na abhantö bha Tobhu na Maaka bhakagita muyuuyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Yoabhu aröchë iga, iriihi rerörrë kumuisiira, mbere na nyuma naahööyë abhamui bha bhasirikare bha Isiraeri abhakarë bhökong'u akabhatööra köröhari götemberrekania na Abhaasuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhasirikare bhaandë bhaara bhaatamërë naabhatigërë köbhötangati bhoa mura omoobho, nawe akabhaseemia götemberrekania na Abhaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabhu agateebhia Abhisai iga, “Hano wanyoore Abhaasuru mbankiria ichinguru, nööraache guntuurria, na hano wanyoore Abhaamoni mbagukiria ichinguru nëndaache kugutuurria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si ötërëmëke, na tuitane gësaacha gikugira ya abhantö bhaitö ni imigi gë Ënooköë weitö, na ÖMÖNENE atokorre öbhöhanchi bhooe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, Yoabhu hamui na abhantö bhaae bhagasugatëra guitana na Abhaasuru, nabho bhakang'osa mbere yaabho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Abhaamoni bhaarööchë iga Abhaasuru bhang'osërë, nabho guiki bhakang'osa Abhisai na kuihëngëërra kumugi. Yoabhu agatëëmböra guitana na Abhaamoni akaringa Yerusaremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si hano Abhaasuru bhaaröchë iga bhakërröë na Abhaisiraeri, bhakairania hamui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatateseri agatömana iga Abhaasuru bhano bharëngë ihumbu ya ömooro go Yubhurati bharentöë na kuhirua Heramu bhatangatëröë na Sobhaki ömökönaare wi iricheesi re Hatateseri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Tauti aanyoorrë amang'ana gayö, nairri hamui Abhaisiraeri bhonsui akaröbhöka ömooro go Yorotani bhakaya kuya kuhika Heramu. Na Abhaasuru bhagaiseemia kuya kuiihi guisiira Tauti bhagatanga guitana nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si Abhaasuru bhakang'osa mbere ya Abhaisiraeri. Tauti agaita Abhaasuru amagana muhungatë (700) bhano bharëëngë abhagendia bha amaatoka gi iriihi, abhagendia-bharaasi ibhiköë mërongo ënai (40,000). Na agaseecha Sobhaki ömökönaare wa iricheesi reebho nawe agakuëra hayö bheene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano abhagambi bhonsui abhakoramërëmo bha Hatateseri bhaarööchë iga bhakërröë na Abhaisiraeri, mbaakorrë ubhuiguërrani bhö mërembe na Abhaisiraeri, nabho bhakabha abhakoramërëmo bha Abhaisiraeri. Igo mbe Abhaasuru tëbhasaachërë gutuurria Abhaamoni guiki roondë hai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
